{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot motion and perception as a single automaton. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is used in clear states, move_forward is used only in a short commit state, and obstacle events trigger conservative, one-shot recovery turns. Recovery states use rotate_clockwise or rotate_counterclockwise depending on the obstacle side, and full_rotate is reserved for deadlock (all sides blocked). The supervisor returns to exploration as soon as the path is clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model both motion and perception in a unified plant automaton for clarity and synthesis compatibility.",
    "Specification automaton enforces safe, progress-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward in commit, and conservative turn recovery after obstacles, with quick return to exploration."
